{
  "id": 463340694,
  "iid": 23874,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Disable antialiasing in the info banner on macOS",
  "description": "setjmp on macOS 26.3 and earlier on Arm64 doesn't properly initialize\njmp_buf. This is a problem for us when enabling antialiasing in the info\nbanner because Qt passes the job on to FreeType, which uses\nsetjmp/longjmp at a time when Stratoshark is initializing plugins, which\nmight be written in Go, which in turn is strict about the state of the\nsignal stack.\n\nFixes #21083",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T20:52:38.481Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-03-12T21:13:33.383Z",
